      "filename": "Fouilles du Ramesseum (Egypte) (3912064180).jpg",
      "title": "File:Fouilles du Ramesseum (Egypte) (3912064180).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/e/e7/Fouilles_du_Ramesseum_%28Egypte%29_%283912064180%29.jpg",
